  data: {
    LLM: "Two phases. Phase One: take turns anticlockwise; draw the top card of the talon and place it on your stack, and optionally give away cards from your stack or drawn talon cards onto opponents' stacks when a card fits (next rank above; lowest rank fits on Ace). Phase Two: play in tricks; beat the previous card with a higher card of the same suit or a trump, or pick up the lowest card in the trick. Last player left holding cards loses.",
    Player: "Two phases. Phase One: take turns anticlockwise; draw the top card of the talon and place it on your stack, and optionally give away cards from your stack or drawn talon cards onto opponents' stacks when a card fits (next rank above; lowest rank fits on Ace). Phase Two: play in tricks; beat the previous card with a higher card of the same suit or a trump, or pick up the lowest card in the trick. Last player left holding cards loses.",
    objective: 'Avoid being the last player holding cards at the end of Phase Two.',
    gameplay: "Two phases. Phase One: take turns anticlockwise; draw the top card of the talon and place it on your stack, and optionally give away cards from your stack or drawn talon cards onto opponents' stacks when a card fits (next rank above; lowest rank fits on Ace). Phase Two: play in tricks; beat the previous card with a higher card of the same suit or a trump, or pick up the lowest card in the trick. Last player left holding cards loses.",
    keyRules: [
      'Phase One: accumulate cards, give away cards that fit (next rank higher)',
      "Phase Two: shed cards by beating; pick up lowest if can't beat",
      'Lowest rank fits on Ace (wrap-around)',
      'No obligation to follow suit in Phase Twoâ€”just must beat or pick up',
      'Trumps determined by last talon card drawn',
    ],
